Package: nginx
Version: __PKG_VERSION__
Section: httpd
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libpcre3, zlib1g, libssl3
Maintainer: Echo Build <noasharbat@gmail.com>
Description: nginx 1.25.5 (Echo build) with nginx security backports
 From-source build of nginx 1.25.5 replicating the exact ./configure flags of
 the official nginx:1.25-bookworm Docker image, with the official upstream
 patch for CVE-2024-7347 (mp4 module buffer over-read) applied before compile.
 Depends on libssl3 for the OpenSSL runtime library; the runtime image must
 install/upgrade libssl3 from bookworm + bookworm-security to close
 CVE-2024-6119 (see PROGRESS.md Mission 2 section).
